WS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " The main components of computer architecture"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n4le01ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Speaker</span>: Good evening, we are going to talk about computer architecture. So, let's start by explaining this concept. Computer architecture refers to some methods and rules that define computer systems, in terms of their functions, as well as their organization and implementation. It is a representation of the design requirements for certain parts of the computer, especially the CPU and its internal connection with other parts. For that reason, computer architecture is as important as software architecture and, for some, it is even considered more important. Some examples of computer architecture evolution are MS-DOS operating system, Apple's Lisa, and Microsoft Windows. <br/>"}, {"time": "41300", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Now, let me give you more details about computer architecture. It works through pipeline processors, which consist of linear and sequential segments that perform specific tasks. For instance, the external data are processed by the system and, then, it makes operations with them and with the memory-stored data. Finally, it produces new data for external use. This process can be more complex than others since it involves microarchitecture design, logic design, instruction set architecture design, and implementation."}, {"time": "73500", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob10re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Attendee</span>: Can you explain more about those roles in computer architecture?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Speaker</span>:  Sure, Instruction set architecture (ISA) has the role of an interface between the hardware and the software of the computer. The microarchitecture design improves the software performance by implementing processors that transfer data in a faster way. Finally, though implementation isn't part of the computer architecture field at all, it is as essential as the previous ones since it implies checking the transistors design, creating physical circuits, and validating the final design. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Attendee</span>: What do you mean by validating the final design?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Speaker</span>: It involves checking the functionality of the complete process.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}